  "description": "Floor Area : 125 sqm\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present this superbly spacious and beautifully presented penthouse 2-bedroom apartment offering a rare opportunity to acquire a home of outstanding quality and design. Finished to an excellent standard, the apartment boasts generous proportions throughout, an abundance of natural light, creating a bright and airy living environment. There is excellent storage with two walk in wardrobes, two large storage rooms and a walk in Hot-press. \n\nBenefitting from generously proportioned accommodation and light-filled living spaces throughout. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall with private stairs leading up into the large landing, kitchen, private balcony and a storage closet. You also have two large double bedrooms (master en-suite with private balcony), main bathroom and ample storage closets. \n\nWoodbrook is a highly regarded and much sought after development located just off the Riverwood Road, which is a short drive from Castleknock village. Woodbrook enjoys close proximity to Blanchardstown Centre, Coolmine Train Station, James Connolly Memorial Hospital, The Phoenix Park and The National Aquatic Centre, as well serviced high frequency bus routes, notably the 37 which is a frequent bus route into Dublin City centre. Woodbrook is also immediately accessible to the N3 / M3 / M50 road networks.\n\nThe features are fantastic in this truly unique penthouse apartment with an abundance of space throughout.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nEntrance Hallway\nwith carpet floor, alarm panel, intercom system\n\nLounge - 5.85m (19'2\") x 5.65m (18'6\")\nwith laminate wood floor, feature fireplace with timber surround, double doors onto the sunny balcony area\n\nKitchen - 3.88m (12'9\") x 1.96m (6'5\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.41m (14'6\") x 3m (9'10\")\nwith carpet floor & built in wardrobes, walk in storage closet, double doors leading onto a sunny private balcony\n\nEnsuite - 2.76m (9'1\") x 1.62m (5'4\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b. & shower cubicle with pumped shower, tiled\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.24m (13'11\") x 3.77m (12'4\")\nwith carpet floor & built in wardrobes, walk in storage closet\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.48m (8'2\") x 2.71m (8'11\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with shower attachment, tiled",
